WEBVTT

00:03.960 --> 00:06.750
<b>You want us to go to Nacht Base? Right now?</b>

00:05.000 --> 00:09.420
<b>C'mon, give it back!</b>

00:09.420 --> 00:13.210
<b>Yup. There's a couple people I want you to meet.</b>

00:15.790 --> 00:18.080
<b>Welp, let's head out.</b>

00:18.750 --> 00:22.080
<b>Could you transform before we go?</b>

00:22.830 --> 00:26.290
<b>This definitely can't be good...</b>

00:23.710 --> 00:28.380
<b>Give it back, c'mon!</b>

00:31.710 --> 00:32.580
<b>So cute!</b>

00:34.040 --> 00:34.750
<b>Touching!</b>

00:37.040 --> 00:37.880
<b>So cool!</b>

00:39.080 --> 00:39.830
<b>Charming!</b>

00:48.080 --> 00:53.330
<b>Sunny like the light above, shining bright</b>

00:53.330 --> 00:58.670
<b>That warm, happy smile is so perfect and right</b>

00:58.830 --> 01:04.130
<b>Even when you're sad and tears roll down your cheeks</b>

01:04.250 --> 01:09.040
<b>That's part of what makes you perfect to me</b>

01:09.420 --> 01:14.630
<b>All I can do right now is look up at you in the sky</b>

01:14.790 --> 01:22.830
<b>But I believe in the strength growing in my heart</b>

01:22.960 --> 01:25.420
<b>I'm not just gushing over you</b>

01:25.670 --> 01:28.040
<b>I'm not just dreaming about being you</b>

01:28.210 --> 01:30.830
<b>I want to be, I want to change</b>

01:31.000 --> 01:33.500
<b>This love will power me through it all</b>

01:33.750 --> 01:39.920
<b>It all started that day you stole my heart</b>

01:39.920 --> 01:46.500
<b>My love will never fade, My Dream Girls</b>

01:46.790 --> 01:47.750
<b>So cute!</b>

01:49.080 --> 01:49.880
<b>Touching!</b>

01:52.170 --> 01:53.000
<b>So cool!</b>

01:54.170 --> 01:55.000
<b>Charming!</b>

01:59.920 --> 02:02.830
<b>Here Comes the Lord Squad!</b>

02:04.170 --> 02:06.960
<b>So... you said you had a favor to ask us?</b>

02:07.960 --> 02:12.540
<b>I've noticed I've been performing poorly
in our last few battles.</b>

02:13.250 --> 02:14.080
<b>No shit.</b>

02:15.170 --> 02:18.080
<b>And I didn't tell you, but...</b>

02:18.670 --> 02:22.080
<b>I fought Magia Baiser the other day. Alone.</b>

02:25.000 --> 02:26.920
<b>And what happened?</b>

02:27.290 --> 02:28.500
<b>I...</b>

02:31.960 --> 02:33.830
<b>What're you blushing about?</b>

02:33.830 --> 02:35.670
<b>I-I'm not blushing!</b>

02:37.790 --> 02:41.130
<b>The point is, I lost. She completely dominated me.</b>

02:42.420 --> 02:43.920
<b>I wasn't strong enough.</b>

02:45.000 --> 02:47.960
<b>I didn't realize how weak I was until that moment.</b>

02:49.500 --> 02:53.540
<b>So I need to get stronger. I need to train harder.</b>

02:54.790 --> 02:56.330
<b>And I need your help!</b>

02:56.960 --> 02:58.210
<b>How?</b>

02:59.830 --> 03:00.880
<b>This'll be fun.</b>

03:04.580 --> 03:06.080
<b>Hello?</b>

03:07.540 --> 03:09.380
<b>Sorry if we're intruding...</b>

03:10.830 --> 03:15.290
<b>What the hell? The place is empty.</b>

03:17.630 --> 03:20.670
<b>Use your eyes, then! We're up here!</b>

03:21.460 --> 03:25.040
<b>Sheesh, don't you know you're supposed
to introduce yourself to your superiors?</b>

03:26.830 --> 03:29.420
<b>It's rich seeing you trying to act superior, Loco.</b>

03:29.790 --> 03:32.420
<b>What?! But we totally are, idiot!</b>

03:32.830 --> 03:38.330
<b>Please don't fight... It makes me so sad.</b>

03:43.670 --> 03:44.420
<b>Who're you?</b>

03:45.330 --> 03:49.750
<b>What the hell, Vena-san?
You're supposed to educate the newbies, y'know.</b>

03:49.960 --> 03:51.830
<b>Right, sorry 'bout that.</b>

03:52.250 --> 03:56.210
<b>These are the founding members of Enormita:</b>

03:57.040 --> 03:58.000
<b>Loco Musica,</b>

03:59.000 --> 04:00.420
<b>Leberblume,</b>

04:01.330 --> 04:02.580
<b>Sister Gigant,</b>

04:03.500 --> 04:04.920
<b>and Lord Enorme.</b>

04:05.380 --> 04:09.040
<b>They just got back from a magical girl hunt.</b>

04:09.250 --> 04:11.080
<b>What's a magical girl hunt?</b>

04:11.420 --> 04:15.500
<b>Those four were traveling to other cities,</b>

04:16.540 --> 04:19.630
<b>exterminating the magical girls stationed there.</b>

04:21.880 --> 04:26.540
<b>Magia Baiser, Leoparde, Neroalice.</b>

04:26.920 --> 04:30.290
<b>Vena has shown me footage of your exploits.</b>

04:30.420 --> 04:33.630
<b>Oh, uh, great...</b>

04:34.170 --> 04:36.830
<b>You are so very pathetic.</b>

04:38.130 --> 04:40.880
<b>Excuse me? Where's this coming from?</b>

04:40.880 --> 04:42.710
<b>Quiet, Starless.</b>

04:45.130 --> 04:50.960
<b>You especially, Baiser. What are you doing?
Not trying to defeat any magical girls, certainly.</b>

04:51.170 --> 04:55.750
<b>I've watched you tie, strip, fondle,
and tease the Tres Magia.</b>

04:56.540 --> 04:57.830
<b>Tell me, is this a game to you?</b>

04:58.290 --> 05:00.000
<b>I'm... I'm so embarrassed!</b>

05:00.580 --> 05:01.580
<b>Venalita.</b>

05:01.960 --> 05:02.830
<b>What's up?</b>

05:03.290 --> 05:08.540
<b>You need to get these girls under control.
Our goal is world domination, is it not?</b>

05:09.250 --> 05:13.830
<b>Now isn't the right time.
We need to focus on building our power.</b>

05:14.960 --> 05:16.040
<b>Ridiculous.</b>

05:18.580 --> 05:21.380
<b>We already have more than enough power.</b>

05:21.750 --> 05:26.040
<b>The magical girls we just hunted
barely proved to be a challenge.</b>

05:27.000 --> 05:30.460
<b>We are more than prepared.
None can stand in our way now.</b>

05:31.080 --> 05:34.420
<b>Don't get cocky. Pride comes before the fall, y'know.</b>

05:38.880 --> 05:42.250
<b>I see no point in continuing this argument.</b>

05:46.170 --> 05:51.330
<b>Very well! We shall conquer the world ourselves!</b>

05:53.380 --> 05:56.380
<b>I take it you're betraying us, then?</b>

05:56.920 --> 05:59.500
<b>I don't care how you take it.</b>

06:00.040 --> 06:05.670
<b>Wait, we just met these weirdoes,
and now they're turning on us?</b>

06:05.830 --> 06:09.330
<b>L..Leo-chan, could you save the commentary for later?</b>

06:10.000 --> 06:11.250
<b>You three.</b>

06:12.540 --> 06:17.420
<b>Join us, and all will be forgiven.</b>

06:18.670 --> 06:24.000
<b>Together, we will rule the world as one!</b>

06:25.330 --> 06:30.130
<b>Uh, no thanks. I'm not really interested.</b>

06:35.710 --> 06:39.000
<b>If Baiser's not in, then I'm out!</b>

06:39.000 --> 06:40.290
<b>Wait, really?</b>

06:40.290 --> 06:41.170
<b>Yup!</b>

06:41.250 --> 06:43.170
<b>Alice says she's out, too.</b>

06:43.170 --> 06:47.290
<b>What?! Then why'd you even join Enormita?!</b>

06:47.790 --> 06:50.130
<b>Well, I was kinda forced to...</b>

06:50.130 --> 06:52.500
<b>I'm getting some major déjà vu...</b>

06:53.670 --> 06:54.670
<b>Sister.</b>

06:55.460 --> 06:56.420
<b>Crush them.</b>

06:59.380 --> 07:01.250
<b>I'm so sad...</b>

07:03.880 --> 07:07.790
<b>But if Mistress Lord demands it...</b>

07:10.380 --> 07:12.710
<b>...then I suppose I must.</b>

07:14.080 --> 07:17.040
<b>Holy shit, she's gonna be scary.</b>

07:19.080 --> 07:21.080
<b>Yeah, she looks tough...</b>

07:22.290 --> 07:24.500
<b>Alice-chan, think you can trap her?</b>

07:30.170 --> 07:31.170
<b>Oh?</b>

07:35.290 --> 07:38.080
<b>You've caught me...</b>

07:39.250 --> 07:41.080
<b>Don't forget about us!</b>

07:42.920 --> 07:45.040
<b>Let's get 'er, Baiser-chan!</b>

07:45.170 --> 07:45.830
<b>Yeah!</b>

07:47.210 --> 07:49.500
<b>Put 'er on the defensive!</b>

07:52.790 --> 07:54.960
<b>Damn, that was easy.</b>

07:55.080 --> 07:58.500
<b>No, she's not done! Don't let your guard down!</b>

08:00.830 --> 08:02.380
<b>Holy crap!</b>

08:03.130 --> 08:03.790
<b>Wha...</b>

08:03.960 --> 08:05.170
<b>She's huge!</b>

08:05.380 --> 08:08.960
<b>Stop, you're so mean...</b>

08:12.750 --> 08:15.420
<b>Oh no! She's going to break Alice-chan's dollhouse!</b>

08:15.540 --> 08:18.630
<b>Seriously?! What IS this freak?!</b>

08:26.710 --> 08:29.500
<b>Hey, Sister, don't make a mess.</b>

08:29.500 --> 08:31.170
<b>I'm so sorry.</b>

08:32.130 --> 08:34.500
<b>I'll finish them off right now.</b>

08:37.250 --> 08:42.330
<b>We're gonna get crushed between her tits...</b>

08:44.670 --> 08:47.330
<b>This ain't good, Baiser-chan!</b>

08:49.580 --> 08:51.170
<b>Leo-chan!</b>

08:52.080 --> 08:54.080
<b>Bomb her! Use 'em all!</b>

08:54.790 --> 08:56.290
<b>It might hit you, though!</b>

08:56.290 --> 08:57.460
<b>Just do it!</b>

09:06.130 --> 09:08.380
<b>Are those idiots crazy?</b>

09:08.630 --> 09:10.630
<b>They're gonna get themselves killed.</b>

09:11.170 --> 09:13.380
<b>You okay, Sister?</b>

09:17.460 --> 09:19.790
<b>They got away...</b>

09:21.130 --> 09:24.960
<b>I couldn't defeat them, Mistress Lord.</b>

09:25.170 --> 09:27.420
<b>Blundering fool. You'll be punished for this.</b>

09:27.420 --> 09:29.170
<b>I'm so sorry.</b>

09:29.710 --> 09:33.290
<b>We did gain something, though:
now we know the extent of their power.</b>

09:34.830 --> 09:37.750
<b>We needn't trifle with those weaklings again.</b>

09:43.580 --> 09:44.380
<b>Baiser-chan!</b>

09:46.290 --> 09:49.420
<b>Hey, Leoparde, you're okay.</b>

09:49.960 --> 09:52.580
<b>Baiser-chan saved me!</b>

09:53.670 --> 09:56.380
<b>She used her body as a shield!</b>

09:57.580 --> 10:02.460
<b>Baiser-chan! Baiser-chan, please, wake up!</b>

10:03.630 --> 10:04.670
<b>Baiser-chan!</b>

10:05.750 --> 10:09.750
<b>Leo-chan? Alice-chan? You're okay...</b>

10:11.880 --> 10:13.250
<b>That's good...</b>

10:13.250 --> 10:14.670
<b>Baiser-chan...</b>

10:31.880 --> 10:33.790
<b>Oh, I don't like them,</b>

10:34.630 --> 10:37.000
<b>I don't like them at all!</b>

10:37.670 --> 10:43.080
<b>One, two, three, four...</b>

10:43.960 --> 10:45.290
<b>They're done.</b>

10:46.670 --> 10:48.210
<b>I'm gonna get those stars...</b>

10:48.920 --> 10:50.170
<b>...and make them fall.</b>

10:53.290 --> 10:54.580
<b>Baiser-chan...</b>

10:55.460 --> 10:57.670
<b>You really are one crazy bitch!</b>

10:57.670 --> 10:58.500
<b>Wha-?!</b>

10:59.830 --> 11:02.250
<b>Hey, Mistress Lord!</b>

11:04.250 --> 11:07.750
<b>You sure we should just ignore those Enormita idiots?</b>

11:08.290 --> 11:11.040
<b>Did you not hear her say
we shouldn't mess with them again?</b>

11:11.040 --> 11:13.960
<b>Was I talking to you? No, so shut your mouth.</b>

11:13.960 --> 11:16.960
<b>Very well. Say your piece, Loco Musica.</b>

11:17.790 --> 11:21.250
<b>Let me go squish them like the bugs they are!</b>

11:21.250 --> 11:23.330
<b>Their magical girls are still out there, after all.</b>

11:23.710 --> 11:26.920
<b>Hmm. I won't tolerate failure, you understand.</b>

11:27.830 --> 11:31.000
<b>I sure do! You can count on me.</b>

11:34.040 --> 11:36.380
<b>Go, then, Loco Musica.</b>

11:37.080 --> 11:41.500
<b>Show them the power of the Lord Squad!</b>

11:42.540 --> 11:47.000
<b>The Lord Squad? Christ, could she have
come up with a lamer name?</b>

11:51.210 --> 11:54.880
<b>Lord's gang has betrayed us
and taken Nacht Base for themselves.</b>

11:55.960 --> 11:57.580
<b>We're basically at rock bottom here.</b>

11:59.880 --> 12:04.040
<b>Who cares about that?!
Are you feeling better, Utena-chan?! I'm so sorry!</b>

12:04.040 --> 12:06.250
<b>It's okay, Kiwi-chan.</b>

12:06.710 --> 12:07.790
<b>But...</b>

12:09.670 --> 12:12.000
<b>I think I want to rest a little more.</b>

12:13.000 --> 12:14.790
<b>Okay! We'll leave!</b>

12:15.080 --> 12:17.580
<b>I'll bring you a present next time we visit! Bye-bye!</b>

12:20.710 --> 12:26.000
<b>Vena-san, you knew Lord and the others
were going to betray us, didn't you?</b>

12:26.710 --> 12:28.630
<b>What makes you say that?</b>

12:29.380 --> 12:34.790
<b>Before we went to Nacht Base, you had us transform.</b>

12:35.710 --> 12:40.960
<b>You did that so they wouldn't be able to know
our true identities, right?</b>

12:40.960 --> 12:42.710
<b>Damn, you're smart.</b>

12:43.170 --> 12:47.330
<b>You're really thinking like a villain now, huh?</b>

12:47.330 --> 12:48.460
<b>That's the least of it.</b>

12:49.040 --> 12:51.170
<b>What the hell is a magical girl hunt?</b>

12:51.170 --> 12:54.330
<b>Why didn't you mention those to me before?!</b>

12:54.330 --> 12:58.580
<b>And why are we even hunting them in the first place?!</b>

12:58.580 --> 13:04.670
<b>Do you even know how important
magical girls are?! Apparently not!</b>

13:04.670 --> 13:08.080
<b>I'm pissed! Pissed at Lord, and pissed at you!</b>

13:08.210 --> 13:10.880
<b>You need to treat magical girls
like the treasures that they are!</b>

13:10.880 --> 13:12.710
<b>Are you even listening to me right now?!</b>

13:13.080 --> 13:16.670
<b>I hate that I'm probably playing
right into your little hands,</b>

13:16.670 --> 13:20.880
<b>but I'm gonna beat the pulp out of Lord
and her lackies, okay?! So there!</b>

13:21.790 --> 13:23.830
<b>Looks like you're feeling better already.</b>

13:28.750 --> 13:29.790
<b>Azure!</b>

13:30.040 --> 13:33.330
<b>Stop, Magenta. She doesn't need your help.</b>

13:35.420 --> 13:39.540
<b>C'mon, get the hell up. You can't stop here.</b>

13:40.460 --> 13:42.540
<b>Don't you wanna get stronger?</b>

13:45.170 --> 13:46.380
<b>Yes, I do!</b>

13:48.040 --> 13:49.210
<b>You ready for me?</b>

13:49.750 --> 13:50.460
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:55.040 --> 14:00.250
<b>Utena-chan! It's my fault! It's all my fault!</b>

14:00.460 --> 14:03.540
<b>Oh, right! I gotta think of a present!</b>

14:03.880 --> 14:06.250
<b>What do you think, Korisu? What should we get her?</b>

14:07.670 --> 14:13.830
<b>I could do that cliché,
and say that I'm her get-well present.</b>

14:15.790 --> 14:20.130
<b>What's that look for? Fine, do you have a better idea?</b>

14:21.080 --> 14:25.250
<b>Huh? A toy? C'mon, now...</b>

14:27.080 --> 14:30.330
<b>C'mon, show yourselves, Enormita!</b>

14:31.040 --> 14:34.250
<b>Loco Musica of the Lord Squad is here to face you!</b>

14:35.290 --> 14:37.540
<b>Cocky little bitch...</b>

14:38.330 --> 14:40.290
<b>I'll blow her to smithereens!</b>

14:41.380 --> 14:43.880
<b>Hey, Korisu! Let me go!</b>

14:55.040 --> 14:58.130
<b>No one can stop Kiwi-chan!</b>

14:58.250 --> 14:59.710
<b>Hey, you stupid bitch!</b>

15:01.000 --> 15:04.830
<b>Say your prayers, 'cause I'm about to blow you to pieces!</b>

15:05.920 --> 15:08.170
<b>Well, look who it is.</b>

15:08.500 --> 15:10.830
<b>The Starless wonder, Leoparde-chan.</b>

15:12.670 --> 15:15.830
<b>What is a weakling like you doing, facing me?</b>

15:16.040 --> 15:18.670
<b>Don't tell me you seriously think you can beat me.</b>

15:19.290 --> 15:22.130
<b>I can tell by the dumb look on your face
that you're confused.</b>

15:22.500 --> 15:25.290
<b>See these stars on my skin here?</b>

15:26.080 --> 15:29.000
<b>They're proof of just how powerful I am!</b>

15:29.460 --> 15:32.750
<b>A starless weakling like yourself is no match for me!</b>

15:33.130 --> 15:35.170
<b>Does it look like I care, moron?</b>

15:35.580 --> 15:39.420
<b>Anyone who messes with Baiser-chan
is gonna get blown up!</b>

15:39.960 --> 15:42.080
<b>I'd like to see you try!</b>

15:45.580 --> 15:46.960
<b>Voix Forte!</b>

15:48.500 --> 15:51.330
<b>What the-? She can use her voice as a weapon?!</b>

15:56.420 --> 15:59.000
<b>Crap, I can't block them all!</b>

16:02.040 --> 16:03.210
<b>Neroalice!</b>

16:05.420 --> 16:06.710
<b>Thanks, Alice!</b>

16:08.290 --> 16:13.750
<b>More of you, now?! Stop fighting
and pledge yourselves to Lord already!</b>

16:14.080 --> 16:17.580
<b>Hell no. We don't care about ruling the world.</b>

16:17.920 --> 16:20.420
<b>Like, why do YOU even want that?</b>

16:21.420 --> 16:23.710
<b>Why, I'm glad you asked!</b>

16:24.080 --> 16:28.290
<b>When Mistress Lord rules the world,
I'll have a place in it...</b>

16:31.330 --> 16:33.880
<b>...as the number one pop idol!</b>

16:36.210 --> 16:36.830
<b>What...?</b>

16:36.960 --> 16:42.290
<b>Everyone on the planet will worship me!
Doesn't that sound like paradise?</b>

16:42.500 --> 16:46.210
<b>Before I send you to Hell,
I'll let you hear my fabulous theme song!</b>

16:47.670 --> 16:49.790
<b>Wait, is that music? Where's it coming from?</b>

16:52.540 --> 16:55.330
<b>LOVELY LOCO</b>

16:52.540 --> 16:55.330
<b>Written and Performed by Loco Musica</b>

17:04.130 --> 17:05.750
<b>Loco's so lovely!</b>

17:05.750 --> 17:07.500
<b>Lovely Loco!</b>

17:07.500 --> 17:10.460
<b>Everyone loves her from head to toe</b>

17:11.040 --> 17:14.460
<b>She's super super cute, a miracle girl!</b>

17:14.540 --> 17:16.130
<b>And her name's Loco, Loco,</b>

17:16.130 --> 17:17.540
<b>Loco Musica!</b>

17:17.960 --> 17:21.130
<b>She can hear your achy-breaky heart</b>

17:21.420 --> 17:24.710
<b>How it's been pounding so loud from the start</b>

17:24.960 --> 17:28.040
<b>It's okay if you wanna fall in love with Loco</b>

17:28.170 --> 17:31.790
<b>But she can't love you back, it's a no-go</b>

17:31.960 --> 17:34.630
<b>I'm sorry, I'm so flattered you feel that way,</b>

17:34.710 --> 17:36.630
<b>but I belong to everyone, okay?</b>

17:37.040 --> 17:40.830
<b>Everyone's idol, Loco Musica!</b>

17:40.830 --> 17:44.040
<b>She sings like a dove!</b>

17:44.130 --> 17:45.500
<b>Zoom, zoom, kaboom,</b>

17:45.500 --> 17:47.210
<b>Here comes her love!</b>

17:47.500 --> 17:48.920
<b>Rock on, locked on,</b>

17:48.920 --> 17:50.880
<b>Coming down from above!</b>

17:51.040 --> 17:52.460
<b>Zoom, zoom, kaboom,</b>

17:52.460 --> 17:54.330
<b>Here comes her love!</b>

17:54.540 --> 17:55.960
<b>Rock on, locked on,</b>

17:55.960 --> 17:59.290
<b>Coming down from above!</b>

18:05.880 --> 18:07.250
<b>Thanks, everyone!</b>

18:07.250 --> 18:09.040
<b>Encore! Psych, kill me.</b>

18:09.040 --> 18:11.670
<b>Well? Are you totally smitten with my beautiful voice?</b>

18:12.000 --> 18:13.580
<b>Wow, what do I even say?</b>

18:14.130 --> 18:20.000
<b>The lyrics are lame as hell, and your singing
is so bad it's not even funny, it's just sad.</b>

18:21.540 --> 18:24.880
<b>Wh-what? My singing... is bad?</b>

18:25.080 --> 18:25.750
<b>Yup.</b>

18:27.670 --> 18:30.420
<b>It's... It's not bad!</b>

18:32.830 --> 18:35.710
<b>I'm a great singer!</b>

18:37.040 --> 18:42.420
<b>And my lyrics are cool and cute!</b>

18:42.420 --> 18:45.960
<b>Uh, sorry. I didn't think you'd actually cry.</b>

18:52.000 --> 18:54.000
<b>She's totally lost her shit!</b>

18:54.290 --> 18:56.670
<b>She's not even aiming anymore!</b>

18:57.880 --> 18:59.880
<b>VOIX FORTE!</b>

19:03.750 --> 19:07.750
<b>This doesn't look good,
but we might have a chance here, Alice!</b>

19:09.790 --> 19:13.420
<b>I hate you! I hate you! I hate everyone!</b>

19:16.630 --> 19:19.080
<b>What's with all these dolls?!</b>

19:19.880 --> 19:21.920
<b>GO AWAY!</b>

19:28.710 --> 19:30.170
<b>Flash bombs?!</b>

19:32.080 --> 19:33.830
<b>Where'd they go?!</b>

19:35.880 --> 19:39.210
<b>No way... No way! They got away?!</b>

19:39.500 --> 19:41.580
<b>Mistress Lord is gonna kill me...</b>

19:43.540 --> 19:49.830
<b>Leoparde! Neroalice! Where are you?!
Get out here right now!</b>

19:50.750 --> 19:54.330
<b>Idiot. I'm not that gullible.</b>

19:58.580 --> 20:02.750
<b>Okay, fine. Next time, I'll think before jumping into a fight.</b>

20:04.330 --> 20:06.380
<b>And uh, Korisu?</b>

20:08.290 --> 20:12.250
<b>I'm sorry... for breaking another one of your dolls.</b>

20:12.830 --> 20:15.380
<b>I'll buy you a new one, okay?</b>

20:18.920 --> 20:25.790
<b>What? You want me to fix that one instead?
But I don't know how to sew!</b>

20:31.920 --> 20:33.580
<b>I won't hear any excuses.</b>

20:34.080 --> 20:34.790
<b>Strip.</b>

21:02.080 --> 21:03.500
<b>Drop those hands.</b>

21:22.750 --> 21:25.500
<b>I told you I would not tolerate failure.</b>

21:22.750 --> 21:28.500
<b>I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</b>

21:26.790 --> 21:28.500
<b>These matters are beneath me...</b>

21:31.040 --> 21:33.420
<b>...so do not bother me with them again!</b>

21:34.040 --> 21:35.670
<b>M-Mistress Lord...</b>

21:37.630 --> 21:41.460
<b>Fail me again, and I will crush you
and your pathetic dreams.</b>

21:41.920 --> 21:44.670
<b>Remember that as I beat this lesson into you.</b>

22:08.170 --> 22:13.830
<b>Truth is, I want to be cuter, want to be sweeter</b>

22:14.000 --> 22:16.830
<b>I can't help that I'm a bad girl, sorry</b>

22:17.710 --> 22:19.960
<b>I just wanna bully you</b>

22:20.250 --> 22:25.880
<b>You're so precious, so perfect, I love you so much it hurts</b>

22:26.040 --> 22:33.000
<b>But the love I want to give you is brutally sadistic</b>

22:33.170 --> 22:35.960
<b>I was just a sweet girl</b>

22:36.210 --> 22:39.080
<b>Innocently dreaming of being the main character</b>

22:39.250 --> 22:44.830
<b>Wondering sadly why I couldn't be like that</b>

22:44.830 --> 22:50.710
<b>Then boom, it came to me, and suddenly I was under its spell</b>

22:50.830 --> 22:53.790
<b>I can't focus on school or anything</b>

22:53.790 --> 22:56.960
<b>I'm stuck fantasizing about every situation</b>

22:57.130 --> 23:02.330
<b>Lighting the fuse and having some explosive fun</b>

23:02.710 --> 23:08.210
<b>Might not be so bad after all</b>

23:08.210 --> 23:13.880
<b>Truth is, I want to be cuter, want to be sweeter</b>

23:14.040 --> 23:19.750
<b>But I'm gonna write my own story, walk my own path for me</b>

23:20.130 --> 23:22.290
<b>I wanna see her shine brighter</b>

23:22.290 --> 23:25.830
<b>I wanna see her be even more powerful</b>

23:26.040 --> 23:33.080
<b>So accept my special kind of love, this top-shelf fetish</b>

23:36.170 --> 23:41.040
<b>Gushing Over Pop Idols!</b>
